    "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:wystan30@gmail.com\">wystan30@gmail.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f68ea7ff623a7eb7954793090d023ed4.avif?t=1751559588\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a disciple representing your sect, compete in the legendary Martial Arts Tournament to seize the lost forbidden scrolls. Master your sect\u2019s signature techniques, combine them with powerful martial manuals, and wield divine weapons from the Armory Codex to forge your unique combat style. Face ever-evolving challenges from formidable rivals\u2014your goal is simple: <strong>claim glory in a single legendary battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Relics Boost Stats, Manuals Reshape Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Jianghu Relics</strong> (White/Blue/Purple/Gold tiers) to enhance stats and unleash item skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Martial Manuals</strong> to either empower or completely transform your sect\u2019s abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Strategic Resource Management &amp; Build Freedom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited funds per round</strong>: Carefully curate purchases from shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load capacity system</strong>: Optimize equipment and relics within weight limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four-Manual Synergy</strong>: Equip four manuals to unlock world-shattering combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Forge Divine Weapons via Relic Synthesis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every relic is a crafting ingredient. Visit the blacksmith to fuse relics into legendary weapons\u2014<strong>inheriting base stats</strong> while gaining <strong>new unique skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Diverse Sects, Unique Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/122638e13f5ae4215b60586dbda61be7.avif?t=1751559588\" data-has-big width=800 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect offers distinct skills, manuals, and <strong>fully voiced backstories</strong>. Unlock their tales to explore characters\u2019 heroic deeds and quirky daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Cinematic Martial Arts Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No static slashing here! Experience <strong>bone-crunching combat</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face-to-face melee exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-second offense/defense transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal counterattacks exploiting enemy vulnerabilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6. Ultimate Move Spectacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sect boasts a <strong>showstopping ultimate ability</strong>\u2014unleash dazzling animations to decisively end battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7. More to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b9902d6da30ba91b383424998f561c3a.poster.avif?t=1751559588\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b9902d6da30ba91b383424998f561c3a.webm?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b9902d6da30ba91b383424998f561c3a.mp4?t=1751559588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect features a uniquely designed <strong>Fame (Talent) System</strong>. As you ascend tiers in the Martial Arts Tournament, you earn Fame to unlock critical nodes in the system, allowing you to forge your preferred combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming soon</strong>: Additional gameplay modes and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to carve your legend in the Jianghu!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
